[en.FOCUS_C18_000_PLANTATION_IMPROVE]
Agriculture Improvement

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_PLANTATION_IMPROVE_desc]
As we gradually enter the modern era, the concept of agriculture must progress with it: we need higher-yield crops, more efficient farming methods, and better agricultural infrastructure, rather than relying solely on winning by quantity.

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_PLANTATION_IMPROVE_TOOLTIP]
The foal’s breath production efficiency of §Yfarm§! is further increased by §G25%§! (total efficiency increase is §Y37.5%§!)

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_PLANTATION_IMPROVE]
农业改良

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_PLANTATION_IMPROVE_desc]
随着我们逐渐进入现代，农业的理念必须随之进步：我们需要更高产量的农作物，更高效的耕作方式，以及更好的农业基础设施，而不是仅仅依赖于从数量上取胜。

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_PLANTATION_IMPROVE_TOOLTIP]
§Y农场§! 的稚马之息生产效率进一步提高 §G25%§!（总提升效率为 §Y37.5%§!）

